Honcho Inspector is a multi-tenant inspector and dashboard for
Honcho workspaces, with admin RBAC, user management, audit logging,
and a JSONL application log. It is the operator-facing companion
to the Honcho memory and social-cognition platform.

This port installs the Spring Boot 3.5 / Java 25 service jar, a
launcher that runs as the unprivileged `www` user, a `rc.d` service
script, a sample configuration at %%ETCDIR%%/application.yml.sample,
and a placeholder env file for the crypto key at
%%ETCDIR%%/honcho-inspector.env.sample.

WWW: https://github.com/cloudbsdorg/honcho-inspector-backend
